From: Oreon Packaging Team <packaging@oreonhq.com>
Subject: [PATCH] build with flit_core 4

flit_core 4 no longer reads [tool.flit.metadata]; docutils already uses
the [project] table. flit's 4.0 release notes say such projects can
raise the cap from <4 to <5.
---
--- a/pyproject.toml	2026-11-23 15:26:46.101529959 -0800
+++ b/pyproject.toml	2026-11-23 15:26:46.105529840 -0800
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@
 # Use flit as a build backend (https://flit.pypa.io/)
 # Build with (https://build.pypa.io/)
 [build-system]
-requires = ["flit_core>=3.11,<4"]
+requires = ["flit_core>=3.11,<5"]
 build-backend = "flit_core.buildapi"
 
 # Project metadata
